{"id":"e4ead14ef2e73cf9","group":"58","path":"58/batch11/58-df-zfc-rel-total-relation.md","title":"ZFC Rel Total Relation","display":"df-zfc-rel-total-relation — ZFC Rel Total Relation","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-rel-total-relation","aliases":["58-df-zfc-rel-total-relation"],"display":"df-zfc-rel-total-relation — ZFC Rel Total Relation","depends_on":["[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-rel-total-relation"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-rel-total-relation</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-rel-total-relation — ZFC Rel Total Relation"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"41276343f41b253b\" href=\"?note=41276343f41b253b\" title=\"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on\">../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R,X\\in V\">\\(R,X\\in V\\)</span> (relation and carrier)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S\\)</span> (relation-on-set predicate from dependency)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcRelTotalRelation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcRelTotalRelation}_S\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}total\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelTotalRelation}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land \\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}total\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelTotalRelation}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land \\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Quantifying also over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x=y\">\\(x=y\\)</span> forces reflexivity; the former equality disjunct incorrectly permitted missing diagonal pairs.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on","status":"resolved","id":"41276343f41b253b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch14/58-df-zfc-relation-on]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"R,X\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{RelationOn}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcRelTotalRelation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}rel\\text{-}total\\text{-}relation} \\vdash \\mathrm{ZfcRelTotalRelation}_S(R,X)\\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{RelationOn}_S(R,X)\\land \\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\bigl(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle y,x\\rangle\\in R\\bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"x=y","display":false}],"bytes":895,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3324","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch11/58-df-zfc-rel-total-relation.md|58-df-zfc-rel-total-relation]]（batch11）"}],"outgoing":["41276343f41b253b"]}